                            {
                              "id": "1768816318331_1",
                              "name": "prompt",
                              "type": "string",
                              "value": "Your job is to identify the best matching record from an input  array of records , mathcing to the input string provided. Each record in the array represents a {{$context.$nodes.RESOLVE_CONTENT_ITEM_IDS_FOR_EACH_CONTENT_TYPE.IDENTIFY_CONTENT_TYPE_LABEL.$output.result}}  record.\n\nINPUTS :\narray : {{$context.$nodes.RESOLVE_CONTENT_ITEM_IDS_FOR_EACH_CONTENT_TYPE.RESOLVE_EACH_CONTENT_VALUE_WITH_TOKEN_LIKE_CLAUSE.TRIM_UNWANTED_ELEMENTS_FROM_PAYLOAD.$output.result}}\nstring : {{$context.$nodes.RESOLVE_CONTENT_ITEM_IDS_FOR_EACH_CONTENT_TYPE.RESOLVE_EACH_CONTENT_VALUE_WITH_TOKEN_LIKE_CLAUSE.$currentItem.key}}\n\nINSTRUCTIONS :\n1. For the given string input, search for a macthing record in the array using the \"Name\" attribute of records in the array. If a matching record is found extract the ContentItemId and Name of the record else use -1 as ContentItemId. Do not assume matching records if logically doesnt match with the Name of the record.\n2. Return the result in below JSON format (Strict). Do not append leading or  trailing spaces to values.\n{\n\"Name\":\"<Input String>\",\n\"ContentItemId\":\"<Content item id found from step1>\",\n\"NameAvailableInLOV\":<Name of the matching record found from step 1>\n}"
                            }
                          ],
                          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"NameAvailableInLOV\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"ContentItemId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"Name\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
                          "type": "LLM"
